	"title"		"FireWatch - Campfire Monitor"
	"description"		"[b]Keep your campfires burning![/b]

FireWatch adds a small panel to the HUD that lists your burning campfires, so you can see at a glance which one is about to go out.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Burn bar per campfire[/b], coloured green > yellow > red as it burns down (values above 100% are shown as-is)
[*][b]Lowest first[/b] - the fire closest to going out is always on top (up to 10 fires)
[*][b]Click a row[/b] to glide the camera to that campfire
[*]Optionally the cursor lands right on the fire, so you can press [b]R[/b] to add wood straight away
[*]Lives inside the game HUD: hides on menus, loading screens and the naval map, and when no campfire is burning
[*]Keeps updating while the game is paused
[/list]

[h2]Mod option[/h2]
Settings > Mods > [b]FireWatch - Move cursor to clicked fire[/b] (On / Off, default On). With Off, clicking a row only moves the camera.

[h2]Source[/h2]
[url=https://github.com/ringuh/whiskerwood-firewatch]GitHub[/url]

Created using the [url=https://github.com/Whiskerwood-Modding/Whiskerwood-Project]Whiskerwood modkit[/url]."
	"changenote"		"First release"
